# .vercelignore — files Vercel must NOT bundle when deploying /app/frontend.
#
# The repository root is /app, but the Vercel project root is /app/frontend.
# Anything inside /app/frontend that we don't want shipped goes here.
#
# Note: /app/backend (the FastAPI proxy) lives OUTSIDE this folder so Vercel
# already ignores it by default. This file exists for in-folder hygiene.

# Local build artefacts
.next
node_modules
.turbo

# Local-only test fixtures and credentials
**/test_credentials.md
../memory/test_credentials.md

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.log
